Third-party work
================

rime-ice (雾凇拼音) — https://github.com/iDvel/rime-ice
------------------------------------------------------
The Chinese and English dictionaries that `make dict` compiles into the app
(cn_dicts/8105.dict.yaml, cn_dicts/base.dict.yaml, en_dicts/en.dict.yaml)
come from rime-ice and are licensed under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 only. They are downloaded at build time from the commit pinned as
RIME_ICE_REV in the Makefile and bundled, converted, in the app.

librime — https://github.com/rime/librime
-----------------------------------------
The Chinese engine in Sources/FluentCore (Lexicon, SyllableGraph,
FullPinyin, ChineseTranslator, ChineseComposer, UserDictionary) ports
algorithms from librime: the syllable graph and its pruning, candidate
ordering, sentence making, completion and auto-correction spellings, partial
selection and the user dictionary formulas.
